sentences.text:
Therefore, following the decisions taken in MCRC No. 2414/2011 (M/s R.Jagdish Tea Company vs. State of MP), decided on 4.2.2015;
and MCRC No. 4296/2012 (Udaibhan Singh and others vs. State of MP), decided on 5.2.2015, the cognizance taken under Section 2 (i), Section 7 (i) read with Section 16 (1) (a) (i) of the Act of 1954,
to the extent it relates to adulteration only, is hereby set aside.
